<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Sales of 11,800 MT were down 87 percent from the week earlier and 79 percent below the 4-week average.  Mexico (10,800 MT) and Israel (900 MT) were the buyers.</p>
<p>Exports of 72,600 MT slid 38 percent from the previous week and 29 percent from the 4-week average.  The major destination was Mexico (48,500 MT).</p>
</text>
